@startuml A2_layer_service_microservices
title Service Layer – Microservices Overview

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #000000
  BorderThickness 1
}

package "Edge (north–south)" as EDGE_LAYER {
  rectangle "**Load balancer**\nTLS · health · routes → Agent" as ELB
}

package "Service Layer - Microservices" as SERVICE_LAYER {
  
  rectangle "**Agent Service**\nservices/agent_ai\n**8000**" as AGENT {
    rectangle "• LangGraph orchestration\n• Chat API (sync/stream)\n• Auth & sessions\n• Tools: rag_search, prereqs,\n  program, web search" as AGENT_CORE
  }
  
  rectangle "**RAG API**\nservices/rag_api\n**8010** (host; 8000 in container)" as RAG {
    rectangle "• Document ingest & chunking\n• Vector search (pgvector\n  or optional Atlas Mongo)\n• Shared JWT with agent" as RAG_CORE
  }

  rectangle "**Prerequisite Gateway**\nservices/rag_graph\n**8102** (host; 8000 in container)" as RAG_GRAPH {
    rectangle "• /prereqs, /program\n• Read-only Neo4j access\n• Curated curriculum graph" as RAG_GRAPH_CORE
  }
  
  rectangle "**Enrollment Service**\n(not in repo yet)\n**8090** (planned)" as ENROLLMENT {
    rectangle "• Degree audit, scenarios\n• Schedule optimization\n• Transfer & budget APIs" as ENROLLMENT_CORE
  }
}

ELB --> AGENT : /api/v1/*\n(optional in local dev)

database "Postgres\n(Relational + Vector)" as DB
database "Neo4j\n(Knowledge Graph)" as NEO4J
cloud "OpenAI\n(LLM + Embeddings)" as OPENAI
cloud "Observability\n(Prometheus, Grafana, Langfuse)" as OBS

' Service interactions
AGENT --> RAG : HTTP + JWT\n/embed, /query, doc proxy
AGENT --> RAG_GRAPH : HTTP\nprereqs & program tools
AGENT ..> ENROLLMENT : **planned**\nHTTP APIs
ENROLLMENT ..> RAG : **planned**\ncontext retrieval

' Data connections
AGENT --> DB : sessions, state
RAG --> DB : vectors, chunks
RAG_GRAPH --> NEO4J : Cypher reads
ENROLLMENT ..> DB : **planned**
ENROLLMENT ..> NEO4J : **planned**

' External
AGENT --> OPENAI : LLM completions
RAG --> OPENAI : embeddings
AGENT --> OBS
RAG --> OBS
RAG_GRAPH --> OBS
ENROLLMENT ..> OBS : planned

note right of AGENT
**Stateful Orchestrator**
FastAPI + LangGraph + SQLModel
Main entry point for students
Enrollment assistance tools
end note

note right of RAG
**Stateless RAG API**
FastAPI + LangChain loaders
Embeddings → vector DB only
(no Neo4j in this service)
end note

note right of RAG_GRAPH
**Neo4j gateway**
FastAPI + official driver
Separate from rag_api
end note

note right of ENROLLMENT
**Target architecture**
No `enrollment_api` package
in the repo yet
end note

@enduml


